description:
World Wars Tanks is a free online tactical tank arcade game dedicated to the major battles of World War II. Kpfw. IV; and the American M Sherman, M, M Lee, and others.
Choose one of four main factions:
USSR – durable and widely produced tanks with excellent cross-country ability;
Germany – powerful armor and highly accurate guns;
USA – balanced vehicles with good mobility and reliability.
UK – heavy armor and powerful guns.

instructions:
The goal of the game is to complete all the tasks, while annoying Granny.
PC controls:

WASD - move;
Shift - run;
Space - jump;
E - put/take;
F - interact;
LMB - throw/shoot.

Mobile device controls:
Right swipe - camera movement;
Left joystick - player movement.

Controls for smartphones:
• Hold your finger to make the Wave fly up;
• Don't press anything to make the Wave fly down.

Controls for computers:
• Hold the left mouse button/space to make the Wave fly up;
• Don't press anything to make the Wave fly down;
• Q - add a checkpoint in practice mode;
• E - delete the last checkpoint in practice mode;
• ESC / P / TAB - pause.

• Tap the emoji that matches the word shown on the screen;
• Each round gets faster, so react quickly before time runs out;
• Build streaks to earn more points and reach higher scores;
• Be careful — one mistake and it's game over;
• Choose your favorite theme and see how far you can go!

Desktop
Movement - WASD keys;
Use - E or LMB;
Hint - H;
Shop - C;
Inventory - TAB;
Magic - Numbers.

Mobile - touch / swipe

he goal of the game is to swim along the river of death to the final castle and defeat the boss, fighting enemies, collecting loot and upgrading the main character.

Controls on PC:
WASD - movement;
Space - jump;
Left Shift - run;
Tab - cursor;
B - inventory.

Controls on phone: touch/swipe.

PC Controls:
Hold the left mouse button and move the mouse to aim;
Release the left mouse button to shoot.

Mobile Controls:
Hold your finger on the screen and move it to aim;
Release your finger from the screen to shoot!

description:
Accurate 2D is a fun 2D game where the player must destroy all his enemies.

Features:
• many levels;
• casual gameplay;
• good graphics.

instructions:
Each level presents a set of words;
Find meaningful connections and group them;
Use logic and knowledge to solve all associations;
Use hints if stuck;
Progress through levels and unlock new themes and challenges.

- Tap on 2 or more connected blocks of the same color to pop them;
- The more blocks you pop at once, the higher your score;
- Clear the entire board for bonus points;
- Plan your moves to finish levels with the fewest taps;
- Use smart strategies and boosters to beat challenging levels!
